1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,628
The heart isn't a stove.

2
00:00:01,628 --> 00:00:03,032
It's a muscle,

3
00:00:03,032 --> 00:00:04,551
and it squeezes.

4
00:00:04,551 --> 00:00:06,144
Each squeeze

5
00:00:06,144 --> 00:00:07,466
pushes blood out into the

6
00:00:07,466 --> 00:00:08,751
arteries, and that

7
00:00:08,751 --> 00:00:10,301
push is the pulse

8
00:00:10,301 --> 00:00:11,907
you feel in your wrist.

9
00:00:11,907 --> 00:00:13,311
The heart pumps it

10
00:00:13,311 --> 00:00:14,792
out through the arteries,

11
00:00:14,792 --> 00:00:15,945
and it comes back through

12
00:00:15,945 --> 00:00:16,734
the veins,

13
00:00:16,734 --> 00:00:17,567
round and

14
00:00:17,567 --> 00:00:18,439
round.

15
00:00:18,439 --> 00:00:20,128
It circulates.

16
00:00:20,128 --> 00:00:21,513
Your heart pumps all of

17
00:00:21,513 --> 00:00:23,148
your blood round your body

18
00:00:23,148 --> 00:00:24,731
in about a minute.
